      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As a Canadian and or Mexican should I request that the USE and USW regions be renamed?\n\nWhen they have a server located within EU I think it's okay to label it as such. \n\nIf VRChat removes the word union from the tool tip, what about the icon? If it remains the flag of the European Union, then aren't we in the same place still? I don't think an outline of europe would work in the small area. \n\n🇳🇴 Are emoji flags still not shown in chrome on windows?\n\nNAW and NAE would be amusing regions, north america east and west and if you try reading the initials like words it's two words for no.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
